WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.940
Audit readiness should not be treated as a one-time project.

2
00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:13.560
Effective organizations build repeatable processes that combine automation, documentation, security controls, traceability, accountability, and continuous improvement.

3
00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:19.360
Sustainable pipelines balance speed and governance by making the right path the easiest path.

4
00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:29.460
Developers should see clear feedback, reviewers should see relevant context, and auditors should receive reliable evidence without emergency reconstruction.

5
00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:36.940
Teams should periodically review pipeline evidence, exception patterns, failed controls, deployment outcomes, and user feedback.

6
00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:41.280
These reviews help improve both delivery performance and control design.

7
00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:44.760
A mature pipeline supports engineering excellence.

8
00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:52.620
It helps teams move quickly while still providing the evidence needed to support operational, security, and compliance objectives.
